e layer’s transform. When released near the center, the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"card snaps back to its resting position."}],"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Interaction_DragView","kind":"identifier"}]}}}